// Walkers v1 acceptance (design/walkers/v1-job/01-solid-bodies.md). The limits are written here:
//   - a visitor who walks in walks out within walkersVisitLimitTicks server ticks (his stops, dwell and dispense waits
//     included), and none is let out where he stands because no way out was free; walkers still in the hall when it
//     closes are let out by the closing, as before (at x30 a walk across the hall takes hours of the calendar);
//   - a day's visitor purchases stay in the range measured by the method of docs/godot-market-visitors.md (five days at
//     x30 in the audit runtime of these tests), widened by 5 % each way for one day of the seed. Walkers v1 measured
//     751-827 (722-851); the food court v1.1 (game ba732d0b) added the hot meal at a standing table (~+144 a day), and the
//     baseline fixes (21.11.2026, the real frame of step()) measured 1002 988 926 929 913: 913-1002, so 867-1052.
const (
	walkersVisitLimitTicks  int64 = 9000 // 15 minutes of server time for the stops, the dwell and the dispense waits
	walkersDayPurchasesLow  int64 = 867
	walkersDayPurchasesHigh int64 = 1052
)

